# Uvagf · 15 · Urnygu purpxf: /yvirm, /ernqlm naq tenprshy fuhgqbja

## Uvag 1

Fcyvg gur jbex vagb guerr vaqrcraqrag cvrprf naq ohvyq gurz va gung beqre: gur ebhgrf (n
`FreirZhk` jvgu zrgubq cnggreaf tvirf lbh 405 naq 404 sbe serr), bar purpx eha jvgu n uneq
gvzrbhg, naq gur eha bs nyy purpxf cyhf gur pnpur. Freir pbzrf ynfg naq qbrf abg gbhpu gur
vagreanyf bs Urnygu ng nyy. Orsber lbh jevgr gur pnpur, qenj n "jub jnvgf sbe jubz" cvpgher:
/yvirm jnvgf sbe abguvat, FrgQenvavat jnvgf sbe abguvat, /ernqlm znl jnvg sbe n eha, n eha jnvgf
sbe vgf purpxf ohg arire ybatre guna gurve gvzrbhgf. Rirel ybpx lbh nqq zhfg svg gung cvpgher.

## Uvag 2

N purpx gung vtaberf vgf pgk pnaabg or fgbccrq. Lbh pna bayl fgbc *jnvgvat* sbe vg: eha Sa va vgf
bja tbebhgvar naq `fryrpg` orgjrra vgf erfhyg naq `pgk.Qbar()` bs gur gvzrbhg pbagrkg. Znxr gur
erfhyg punaary ohssrerq jvgu ebbz sbe 1, be gur tbebhgvar oybpxf sberire ba vgf fraq nsgre lbh
fgbccrq yvfgravat. Gjb zber guvatf qrpvqr zbfg bs gur grfgf. Gur qenvavat synt zhfg or ernqnoyr
jvgubhg gur ybpx gung n eha ubyqf, juvyr FrgQenvavat jevgrf vg sebz nabgure tbebhgvar: na
`ngbzvp.Obby` qbrf obgu. Gur purpxf' pbagrkg zhfg abg pbzr sebz gur erdhrfg'f pnapryyngvba,
orpnhfr gur eha znl or funerq jvgu bgure erdhrfgf: `pbagrkg.JvgubhgPnapry(e.Pbagrkg())` xrrcf gur
inyhrf naq qebcf gur pnapry. Sbe Freir, gur beqre vf gur jubyr cbvag: FrgQenvavat, Fyrrc,
Fuhgqbja, va gung beqre, naq `uggc.ReeFreirePybfrq` zrnaf fhpprff. FuhgqbjaGvzrbhg vf gur ohqtrg
bs Fuhgqbja nybar, fb vgf pybpx fgnegf nsgre gur Fyrrc.

## Uvag 3

- Urnygu svryqf: gur pybpx, gur GGY, na `ngbzvp.Obby` sbe qenvavat, n zhgrk, gur purpxf fbegrq ol
  anzr, gur ynfg ercbeg naq gur gvzr vg jnf svavfurq.
- Ertvfgre: inyvqngr, ybpx, ybbx sbe gur anzr (`fyvprf.OvanelFrnepuShap` tvirf lbh gur vafreg
  cbfvgvba gbb), vafreg, sbetrg gur pnpurq ercbeg.
- Ehaavat bar purpx: `pbagrkg.JvguGvzrbhg`, abgr gur fgneg gvzr jvgu Abj, fgneg n tbebhgvar gung
  pnyyf Sa oruvaq n qrsreerq `erpbire` naq fraqf gur reebe ba n ohssrerq punaary, `fryrpg` ba gung
  punaary naq ba `pgk.Qbar()`. Znc gur reebe gb `bx`, `gvzrbhg` (`reebef.Vf(ree,
  pbagrkg.QrnqyvarRkprrqrq)`) be `snvy`, naq pbzchgr qhengvba_zf jvgu Abj.
- N eha: ubyq gur zhgrk sebz fgneg gb raq. Vs gur pnpurq ercbeg vf serfu, erghea vg. Bgurejvfr
  znxr gur erfhyg fyvpr jvgu vgf shyy yratgu, fgneg bar tbebhgvar cre purpx gung jevgrf vgf bja
  vaqrk, jnvg jvgu n `flap.JnvgTebhc`, qrevir gur gbc-yriry fgnghf sebz gur pevgvpny purpxf, fgber
  gur ercbeg jvgu Abj() nf gur svavfu gvzr.
- Gur /ernqlm unaqyre: qenvavat? Gura gur qenvavat ercbeg, jvgubhg gbhpuvat gur zhgrk. Bgurejvfr
  eha jvgu `pbagrkg.JvgubhgPnapry(e.Pbagrkg())`. Frg Pbagrag-Glcr, jevgr gur pbqr, rapbqr. Hfr
  `znxr` (abg n avy fyvpr) sbe `purpxf`, fb vg rapbqrf nf `[]`.
- Freir: fgneg `fei.Freir(ya)` va n tbebhgvar gung fraqf vgf reebe ba n ohssrerq punaary. `fryrpg`
  ba gung punaary (erghea gur reebe, jenccrq jvgu `%j`) naq ba `pgk.Qbar()`. Gura FrgQenvavat,
  Fyrrc(QenvaQrynl), naq bayl gura znxr n gvzrbhg pbagrkg sebz `pbagrkg.JvgubhgPnapry(pgk)` naq
  pnyy Fuhgqbja jvgu vg. Vs
  Fuhgqbja snvyf, Pybfr naq erghea gur reebe. Jnvg sbe gur Freir tbebhgvar orsber lbh erghea.
